---
manual: element.button.block
lines: [2877, 2887]
testability: interactive
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  button "OK!" do
    append { para "Well okay then." }
  end
  button "Are you sure?" do
    append { para "Your confidence is inspiring." }
  end
end
----------- test code
assert_empty paras, "the blocks wait for a press"

click_on "OK!"

assert_equal ["Well okay then."], paras.map(&:text), "pressing OK! runs its block, and only its block"
